abstract: >-
  AmbientSenseBench generates synthetic smart-home sensor events from
  literature-grounded routine profiles, derives daily behavioural features
  through a shared extraction pipeline, and evaluates unsupervised anomaly
  detectors on four longitudinal routine-change scenarios, including under a
  differentially private feature release. The data and labels are simulated
  research artefacts, not clinical records.
